docs {
  # Consumption — heat (Wärmezähler)

  Heat meter (Wärmezähler) readings for the chosen unit. Shape is identical
  to water consumption but:

  - `unit` is `kWh`
  - Month-end values that messpunkt.io interpolates (`status: "calculated"`,
    `is_synthetic: true`) use `substitution_method: "degree_day_weighted"`
    (VDI 2067) rather than `linear_interpolation`, since heat demand is
    strongly seasonal.
  - Bill `period_consumption.billable_value`, not last minus first reading.

  Default unit `WE 01` (Musterstraße 2-4) has a single heat-meter segment, no
  replacement. In the 2025 billing year its February month end is such an
  interpolated value (`degree_day_weighted`).
}
